namespace DLNFibre.Core

open Matrix MvPolynomial Ideal

universe u

variable {N : ℕ}

/-! ## Brick A — `codim Σ̄^r = cCodim d r` (Proved, general in `r`)

Mirrors the LANDED `r = 0` chain (`DLN.codimRepCanonical_fibre_zero_eq_cCodim`), but stated *about
